g the spells made me revise most of them into being more interesting and clear. Woah, that's 61 pages of document right there. Many spells are also now based on something similar to Clash of Wills instead of Potency.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_description\">Code:</div> <pre class=\"bbcode_code notranslate\" style=\"max-height:calc(30 * 1.4rem + 2 * var(--bbcode-padding) + var(--h-scrollbar-allowance));\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1iryDzCFWDg7xyTwZ9egnWLCpIgYiVMJ6T7SHbjzkynE/edit</pre> </div><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1iryDzCFWDg7xyTwZ9egnWLCpIgYiVMJ6T7SHbjzkynE/edit\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...SHbjzkynE/edit</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/316-jesuncolo","name":"Jesuncolo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar316_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-20T15:09:22-07:00","id":203270,"title":"","content":"This looks really interesting. Do you have any plans to update the warlock that's on the first page to the newer edition?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3527-sidhe_blooded","name":"sidhe_blooded","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-20T22:43:07-07:00","id":203537,"title":"","content":"Yes, I have.<br /> <br /> EDIT:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_description\">Code:</div> <pre class=\"bbcode_code notranslate\" style=\"max-height:calc(30 * 1.4rem + 2 